//     EnterObservedConstrainedSpan sets insideConstrainedOut := true, currentConstrainedOut := [].
//     parser.IsValidPrefix([]) is guaranteed by the method precondition. Invariant holds.
//
//   Phase 2 (OpenConstrainedSpan):
