// Invariant 2: progress
//   |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
//
//   Phase 0: CloseSpanWithinBudget appends at most ib tokens and steps grows by ib;
//     |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps maintained.
//
//   Phase 1 loop — each iteration: UnconstrainedStep costs 1 step (steps += 1).
//     EOS path: generated unchanged, steps += 1; old |generated| <= |generatedPrefix|
//     + (steps-1) <= |generatedPrefix| + steps. Preserved.
//     Non-EOS path: |generated| grows by 1 and steps grows by 1 simultaneously.
//     "<<" path: same as non-EOS, then EnterObservedConstrainedSpan leaves generated
//     unchanged so |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps still holds.
//
//   Phase 2 (OpenConstrainedSpan): appends exactly 1 delimiter token; steps += 1;
//     |generated| + 1 <= |generatedPrefix| + steps + 1. Preserved.
//
//   Phase 3 (CloseSpanWithinBudget with rb = maxSteps - steps_before):
//     postcondition: |generatedOut| <= |generated_before| + rb = |generated_before|
